---
source: src/commands/search.rs
expression: "format_results(\"tracker\", &fixture_search(\"tracker\"))"
---
com.acme/tracker  Acme Tracker
    The official Acme Tracker server.
    remote: https://mcp.acme.example/mcp (needs a token)

dev.tricky/tracker  Tricky rekcart
    Line one line two with hidden marks.
    remote, but its url `http://tricky.example/mcp` is not https

app.linear/linear  Linear  (built in: `plugbay use linear`)
    Find and manage issues, projects, and documents in your Linear workspace.
    remote: https://mcp.linear.app/mcp, https://mcp.linear.app/mcp/readonly

dev.oldco/legacy
    Still on the old transport.
    remote over SSE only, which plugbay doesn't support

org.pyco/finder
    Finds things, from PyPI.
    runs locally: pypi pyco-finder, oci ghcr.io/pyco/finder, mcpb https://github.com/pyco/finder/releases/download/v1.2.0/finder.mcpb

io.github.acme-dev/tracker-mcp  Tracker (community)
    Unofficial tracker tools, run locally.
    runs locally: npm @acme-dev/tracker-mcp

Add one to your catalog with `plugbay add <name> --from <registry-name>`.
